# Bidirectional typing: CALL-MONO argument checking
# A function with annotated Int param is called with an integer literal.
# The type checker uses check_expr (bidirectional checking) for this argument,
# allowing IntLiteral(42) <: Int subsumption to succeed.
[f: [fn [x@Int] $x]
 result: [call $f 42]]
===
Dict({"f": Function(x), "result": Int(42)})
